title: 주3_수_2교시_강의실_양나현_영문
---
<<show hyun_idle>>
<<play hyun_sound>>
NaHyun: (Yawns.)
NaHyun: Oh, hey {name()}.
(NaHyun is standing in front of the classroom.)
(As usual, her face says she really doesn't want to go in.)
<<show hyun_neg>>
NaHyun: I'm so exhausted today. I can't believe how many assignments they're piling on us...
{name()}: Tell me about it. I'm hitting my limit too.
{name()}: I feel like I could sleep for a week.
<<show hyun_idle>>
NaHyun: Same here.
<<if get("lvHyun") < 35>>
    <<jump 주3_수_2교시_강의실_양나현_일반_영문>>
<<else>>
    <<jump 주3_수_2교시_강의실_양나현_특수_영문>>
<<endif>>
===

title: 주3_수_2교시_강의실_양나현_일반_영문
---
NaHyun: Still, I guess I should show up for class.
{name()}: Really?
{name()}: Not even going to pull a "roll-call-and-run"?
NaHyun: Well... finals are coming up soon.
<<show hyun_smile>>
NaHyun: I'm trying to be a bit more responsible now.
{name()}: That's a good attitude. I'll try to focus too, then.
NaHyun: I'll probably pass out if I just sit there, though. Should we grab coffee?
{name()}: Sure. Convenience store?
NaHyun: (Checks the time) We still have some time. Want to go to a real cafe?
<<show hyun_blush>>
NaHyun: ... It's on me today.
{name()}: Oh, for real?
<<choice 주3_수_2교시_강의실_양나현_일반_긍정1_영문 "I'm not gonna say no to that~" 주3_수_2교시_강의실_양나현_일반_부정1_영문 "No, it's okay.">>
NaHyun: You helped me out with the attendance numbers before, and the semester is almost over anyway.
===

title: 주3_수_2교시_강의실_양나현_일반_긍정1_영문
---
{name()}: Thanks! I'll enjoy it then.
<<show hyun_smile>>
(We went to a cafe and grabbed some take-out coffee.)
(We headed back and sat through the lecture together.)
(I was tired, but I felt productive knowing I was working hard.)
<<end>>
===

title: 주3_수_2교시_강의실_양나현_일반_부정1_영문
---
{name()}: That's okay, keep your money.
<<show hyun_shock>>
NaHyun: No, I'm buying.
<<show hyun_smile>>
<<play 양나현_웃음>>
NaHyun: I've been meaning to thank you for everything this semester.
NaHyun: Let's go to that Star-bucks near the back gate.
(We went to the cafe and grabbed some take-out coffee.)
(We headed back and sat through the lecture together.)
(I was tired, but I felt productive knowing I was working hard.)
<<end>>
===

title: 주3_수_2교시_강의실_양나현_특수_영문
---
NaHyun: … Should we ditch class?
{name()}: You want me to send you the attendance code later?
<<show hyun_idle>>
NaHyun: …
(NaHyun locks eyes with me.)
NaHyun: Why don't you skip with me?
NaHyun: You're tired too.
<<choice 주3_수_2교시_강의실_양나현_특수_긍정1_영문 "When you look at me like that, I don't really have a choice." 주3_수_2교시_강의실_양나현_특수_부정1_영문 "But we really should attend the lecture.">>
{name()}: ... ...
===

title: 주3_수_2교시_강의실_양나현_특수_부정1_영문
---
{name()}: I mean, finals are just around the corner...
<<show hyun_neg2>>
NaHyun: ... ...
NaHyun: ... ... ... ...
<<choice 주3_수_2교시_강의실_양나현_특수_긍정1_영문 "Alright, let's just slack off today." 주3_수_2교시_강의실_양나현_특수_부정1_영문 "But we really should attend the lecture.">>
{name()}: (I am pretty tired. Should I just skip?)
===

title: 주3_수_2교시_강의실_양나현_특수_긍정1_영문
---
{name()}: ...Fine.
{name()}: Where should we go if we skip?
NaHyun: Want to go to the club room?
NaHyun: I really need a nap......
{name()}: Okay, let's head to the club room.
<<play 공통_발소리>>
<<bg 낮_동아리방>>
(Maybe because classes were in session, but the club room was empty.)
(The 'Rakku-Rakku' folding bed, which is usually occupied, was actually free.)
(NaHyun fixes her gaze on the bed.)
{name()}: Lucky us. Go ahead and get some sleep.
NaHyun: What about you?
{name()}: Me? I'll just... play some games on the computer.
<<show hyun_blush>>
NaHyun: You're going to stay here, right?
{name()}: Won't it be too noisy?
NaHyun: ... It's fine.
{name()}: Alright then, I'll stay.
(I turned on the club computer opposite the bed and sat down.)
<<show hyun_idle>>
(Looking back, I saw NaHyun set down her things and lie on the bed.)
(I launched WapleStory on the computer.)
(It's NaHyun's favorite game.)
(Checking the friend list, I saw she had been playing even 2 hours ago.)
(I wonder when she even finds the time.)
(Soon, I heard the soft sound of her steady breathing.)
(When I looked back, I saw NaHyun asleep on her side, tucked under a blanket.)
<<choice 주3_수_2교시_강의실_양나현_특수_긍정2_영문 "What is this feeling?" 주3_수_2교시_강의실_양나현_특수_부정2_영문 "(Ignore the strange feeling.)">>
{name()}: ... ...
===

title: 주3_수_2교시_강의실_양나현_특수_긍정2_영문
---
(I closed the game and got up from the chair.)
(I carefully laid down next to NaHyun.)
(The bed felt much narrower than it looked.)
(I ended up lying there, facing her directly.)
(I watched her sleeping face for a moment.)
(Soon, drowsiness washed over me, and I closed my eyes.)
NaHyun: ......
<<hide>>
<<bg 양나현_특수>>
(When I woke up, NaHyun was already awake.)
(We were still lying there, face to face.)
{name()}: ......
(Just as I was thinking about how close we were, I felt something on my arm.)
(We were sharing the same blanket.)
(When did she cover me with it...?)
NaHyun: ... Did you sleep well?
{name()}: Yeah... When did you wake up?
NaHyun: Just now?
(The playful way she smiled made me think she was lying.)
{name()}: I slept longer than I thought... I should probably get up.
NaHyun: Yeah. We both have things to do...
(I got up with NaHyun and we tidied up the bed and the blanket.)
(We said our goodbyes in front of the club room.)
NaHyun: You're actually pretty cute when you're asleep.
NaHyun: See you tomorrow.
(With a laugh, NaHyun turned and walked away.)
<<end>>
===
                
title: 주3_수_2교시_강의실_양나현_특수_부정2_영문
---
(I feel a sudden impulse.)
(But maybe I'm just tired...)
(I leaned back in the chair and took a nap there.)
<<end>>
===